<title>ZAMBIA: ZAMBIA NAMES NEW TAX DEPARTMENT HEAD.</title>
<headline>ZAMBIA NAMES NEW TAX DEPARTMENT HEAD.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Zambian government on Tuesday named former tax commissioner Kevin Donovan as new head of the Zambia Revenue Authority (ZRA).</p>
<p>A ZRA spokesman said Donovan would replace Jim Scott who resigned as ZRA commissioner general in February, three months before his contract expired.</p>
<p>&quot;Donovan's appointment is with immediate effect,&quot; the ZRA spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom +2601 222 689</p>
